  "scope": "Strict incremental UTF-8 decoder over feed/finish/reset events. It buffers incomplete prefixes, validates lead/trail bytes, overlong encodings, surrogates and the Unicode range, counts code points only from successful decode calls, and zeroes the failing chunk on error.",
  "change": "Removed the unsupported ''.join(...) expression and accumulated each decoded scalar directly into text with chr(value), so text starts as an empty string and len(text) is always valid. Preserved the parent decoder's state machine, terminal-status handling and reset semantics."
